id: tp-07-three-lanes
number: 107
name: Three Lanes
description: Pick a lane at deployment and live with it. The middle lane can be shot into and never walked into without going the long way round.
design: Board topology 7 — a comb. Three lanes, joined only at the far end.
design: The wall fingers at x=2 and x=5 run from y=2 to the bottom edge, so the lanes meet only across the top two rows, and the pivot tiles there are HighGround. Deploy commits each player to a lane before the enemy round is declared.

spawn h = Husk
spawn g = Grappler
spawn l = Lobber
spawn s = Stalker

roster a: Vanguard, Wardbearer
roster b: Archer, Threadcaster

